prompt.template:
Based on the following model test results, generate a comprehensive analysis:

## Model Information
- **Model ID**: {{document.document.model.id}}
- **Display Name**: {{document.document.model.displayName}}
- **Parameters**: {{document.document.model.parameters}}

## Test Summary
- **Total Score**: {{document.document.summary.totalScore}} / {{document.document.summary.maxScore}} ({{document.document.summary.percentage}}%)
- **Classification**: {{document.document.summary.classification}}
- **Passed Tests**: {{document.document.summary.passedTests}}
- **Failed Tests**: {{document.document.summary.failedTests}}

## Test Results by Category
{{#each document.document.categories}}
### {{name}}
- Score: {{score}} / {{maxScore}}
- Tests: {{passedTests}} passed, {{failedTests}} failed
{{/each}}

Provide:
1. A brief executive summary (2-3 sentences)
2. Key strengths (bullet points)
3. Notable limitations (bullet points)
4. Recommended use cases
5. Use cases to avoid
6. Any specific configuration recommendations
